From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:15:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Dispatch CryptoDxe from the DXE a priori list

With CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT every DXE module that links DxeCryptLib
carries gEdkiiCryptoProtocolGuid in its depex. The DXE dispatcher
evaluates the depex of all the drivers of the volume before it runs
the ones it found ready, so CryptoDxe, whose depex is TRUE, runs in
the first pass and all of its clients wait for the second one:
SecurityStubDxe, TcgDxe, Tcg2Dxe, SecureBootConfigDxe, FmpDxe,
UserAuthenticationDxe. Without the protocol they were all in the
first pass, in the order of the volume.

TcgDxe, the TPM 1.2 driver, has no dependency and used to be up before
the variable write service. When EnrollDefaultKeys provisions the
Secure Boot keys of a fresh variable store, VariableRuntimeDxe
measures PK, KEK, db, dbx and SecureBoot in PCR 7 through
DxeTpmMeasurementLib, which looks the TCG protocol up at every call
and returns quietly when it is not there yet. With TcgDxe in the
second pass the measurements of that boot are lost: on a TPM 1.2
machine PCR 7 holds the separator only and the event log misses the
seven EV_EFI_VARIABLE_DRIVER_CONFIG events. Tcg2Dxe measures all the
Secure Boot variables itself once the write service is up, TcgDxe
does not.

List CryptoDxe in the DXE a priori file, after PcdDxe: the a priori
drivers run before the depex of the others is evaluated, so the crypto
protocol is there from the start and every client is dispatched in
the first pass, where it was. CryptoDxe needs the PCD protocol only,
for DxePcdLib, and PcdDxe comes first in the list.

TEST=coreboot q35 with the TPM 1.2 of swtpm in QEMU, the nri payload
of ouroBIOS: the TCPA log has the 21 events of the payload without
the crypto protocol again, the seven PCR 7 measurements of the Secure
Boot variables included, with the same digests; 14 before the change.
tools/qemu-smoke.py passes.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
index 6ddc86f..81aa063 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
@@ -155,6 +155,11 @@ APRIORI DXE {
   INF  MdeModulePkg/Universal/ReportStatusCodeRouter/RuntimeDxe/ReportStatusCodeRouterRuntimeDxe.inf
   INF  MdeModulePkg/Universal/StatusCodeHandler/RuntimeDxe/StatusCodeHandlerRuntimeDxe.inf
   INF  UefiPayloadPkg/BlSupportDxe/BlSupportDxe.inf
+!if $(CRYPTO_PROTOCOL_SUPPORT) == TRUE
+  !if $(CRYPTO_DRIVER_EXTERNAL_SUPPORT) == FALSE
+  INF  CryptoPkg/Driver/CryptoDxe.inf
+  !endif
+!endif
 !if $(CAPSULE_SUPPORT) == TRUE
 
